WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 20h: Aftermath of the Garden Battle
Duration: 10 seconds
Context: The two Gardens separate, both heavily damaged. Galbadia Garden begins to descend. The battle is over, but the cost is high.
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The two Gardens slowly disengage from their locked position. Balamb Garden's white and blue structure pulls away from Galbadia Garden's red-brown mass. Both facilities are visibly damaged — sections are charred, walls are collapsed, and exposed internal structures show the violence of their collision.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Galbadia Garden, now without its sorcerous controller, begins to descend. Its hover mechanisms cannot sustain it any longer. The massive red fortress lists to one side as it falls. Debris and wreckage tumble from its exterior, cascading down toward the ocean far below. The battle is over. The immediate threat has been neutralized. But questions remain about what happens next and who was truly behind this invasion.